# Module: Attendance

## Scope

Daily attendance marking (bulk), single-record edits, student attendance history, leave requests (MVP: submit only).

## Key Entities

`AttendanceSession`, `AttendanceRecord`, `AttendanceEditLog`, `LeaveRequest`

## Permissions

```
attendance.records.mark
attendance.records.read
attendance.records.edit
attendance.leave.submit      # parent
attendance.leave.approve     # teacher/admin
attendance.report.read
```

## Commands (MVP)

- `MarkAttendanceCommand` — bulk upsert for class + date
- `UpdateAttendanceRecordCommand` — single edit within edit window
- `SubmitLeaveRequestCommand`, `ApproveLeaveRequestCommand`, `RejectLeaveRequestCommand`

## Status Enum

```csharp
public enum AttendanceStatus { Present, Absent, Late, Excused }
```

## Business Rules

- Unique constraint: `(TenantId, ClassId, Date, StudentId)`
- `AttendanceEditWindowPolicy`: same-day edits only (configurable in tenant settings)
- Cannot mark attendance for future dates
- All students in mark request must be enrolled in the class
- Edit creates `AttendanceEditLog` entry + audit with before/after

## Events

- `AttendanceMarkedIntegrationEvent` — triggers absent parent notification
- `AttendanceEditedIntegrationEvent`
- `LeaveApprovedIntegrationEvent`

## Queries

- `GetClassAttendanceQuery` — all students for class on date (pre-fill for marking UI)
- `GetStudentAttendanceQuery` — history with date range filter

## Background Jobs

- `DailyAbsenteeNotificationJob` — end-of-day summary for unmarked absent students
